                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَهْلَِكَةٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A cause of perdition,</i> or <i>of death.</i> (TA
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بخل</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  (tropical:)  <i>A place of perdition</i> or
<i>death:</i> and <i>a desert:</i> (KL:) or <i>a</i> [<i>desert,</i> or
<i>such as is termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفَازَة</span>; (S, K, TA;) because
persons perish therein; (Z, TA;) or because
it urges [or leads] to perdition. (TA.) See
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَادَّةٌ</span>.

